{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve an empty `DurableConfig` as durable**\n\nThe runner treats `{\"DurableConfig\": {}}` as a durable target with default timeout and retention, but this truthiness check emits `{}` and classifies it as plain. A chained invoke then runs it as a one-shot Lambda invocation instead of a child durable execution. Check for `None` or key presence and add an empty-config test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM74B47m","finding_digest":"d4373ec7c19fab073425550bbb440e3d7ec948a9cd074928b05978308c3ea17c","finding_id":"arf_v1_2q3t5r6bt6vqonbfkuf3wraohv","finding_key":"github/scripts/js_examples/run.py::build_function_maps::empty-durable-config-classification","identity_key":"github/scripts/js_examples/run.py::build_function_maps::empty-durable-config-classification","line":299,"observation_digest":"a2aab5251581456cda3219179be753a941f54079bafff0b027b72ace82f619d5","observation_id":"aro_v1_ukvlkjivqfcwzwrsdelzxz2tvf","path":".github/scripts/js_examples/run.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-01T22:41:03Z","review_id":"arr_v1_kacf4myrr6apsummjtsffldknk","reviewed_base_sha":"631b78d1b505b157eee758662291fc5e2353bbb6","reviewed_head_sha":"043d3decfcd46faf521f8cddcc42c0e71b110cc5","reviewer":"codex","start_line":296,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_5zdsxey5pljfpe2rw27iq2xtlw"},"pull_request":{"number":745},"record_id":"art_v1_wz37eaeghqovpddcqwu3e3w2v4","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-01T22:41:03Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
